@baseUrl = http://localhost:5201

### 1. Nop bai hop le (Tra ve 201 Created -> sau 2s SignalR in 'graded')
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "dtc245200652",
  "assignment": "Bai3-SignalR"
}

### 2. Lay danh sach bai nop (Tra ve 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions

### 3. Nop bai thieu du lieu (Tra ve 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "",
  "assignment": ""
}

### 4. Tra cuu ma bai nop khong ton tai (Tra ve 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/SUB-0000